      "instance_name": "children_holding_hands",
      "label": "children holding hands",
      "description": "Four children are standing in a line, holding hands in a circle, smiling at the camera. The child on the far left is a boy with light skin and short blond hair wearing a blue jacket. Next to him is a girl with light skin and brown hair wearing a dark blue shirt with pink hearts. Next is a boy with dark skin wearing a white shirt. On the far right is a girl with light skin and long brown hair wearing a pink shirt. The text overlay reads 'which one will be a single mom?' and 'the one on the right'.",
