      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "The girl on the right is mapped as the 'single mom' according to the text.",
      "description": "The top text 'which one will be a single mom?' and the bottom text 'the one on the right' together create an analogical mapping where the visual entity 'child_on_right' (the girl on the far right) is explicitly identified by the text as the future single mother. This mapping relies on gender stereotypes and misogynistic assumptions, projecting a predetermined life path onto the girl based solely on her gender and appearance.",
