      "label": "User projected onto the girl on the right as the future single mom",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the girl on the right (child_on_right) through the meme's text, which explicitly identifies her as 'the one on the right' who will be a single mom. This projection is based on the meme's reliance on gender stereotypes and misogynistic assumptions, implying the user (or the viewer) is expected to recognize and accept this predetermined role for the girl based on her gender and appearance.",
